## Project Summary

*AI-generated project summary produced by `/write-summary`, for future AI sessions catching up without re-analyzing line-by-line; may be out of date — re-run to refresh.*

### Purpose

Docker-based launcher for pre-made Claude Code agents. Each persona ships its own model and `CLAUDE.md`; all share OAuth credentials, workspace mapping, slash commands, status line, and toolchain caches. Multiple persistent sessions per agent; prior conversations resume automatically.

### Tech Stack

- Python 3.10+ (host launcher; uses walrus operator and structural unpacking)
- `prompt_toolkit` — full-screen TUI picker
- `python-dotenv` — `.conf` parsing
- Stdlib `readline` (with libedit fallback on macOS) — tab completion in the workspace prompt
- Docker + Compose v2 (host); container is `debian:bookworm-slim` + Claude Code installer + Rust + uv
- No tests, no CI, no lockfile

